VFS0090 Linux repair

The source patches in this repository modify libfprint and its community
Validity VFS0090 driver. They are provided under LGPL-2.1-or-later, as are
the accompanying scripts and documentation. See LICENSE.

Pinned source repositories and revisions are listed in upstream.json.

Upstream work includes:
- libfprint and its contributors: https://fprint.freedesktop.org/
- The gugah libfprint VFS009x fork:
  https://gitlab.archlinux.org/gugah/libfprint
- The VFS0090 driver, originally developed by Nikita Mikhailov and
  Marco Trevisan, and its subsequent contributors:
  https://github.com/3v1n0/libfprint-tod-vfs0090
  https://gitlab.archlinux.org/gugah/libfprint-tod-vfs0090
- Related protocol research by uunicorn:
  https://github.com/uunicorn/python-validity

Upstream copyright notices remain in the fetched sources. This repository
contains patches rather than a vendored copy of the full source tree.
OpenSSL, NSS, GLib and other dependencies retain their own licenses.
